    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 · Setup and trade licence\nThe one flow that runs for **days, not seconds** — so it is built as a case with a stage, not a single execution.\n\n**Top:** the request opens the case, tells the customer exactly what to prepare, and hands you a numbered to-do list.\n\n**Bottom:** every time you post a new stage, the customer hears about it in their own language. Four stages, four messages, no chasing you for updates.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-453",
      "name": "Note 453",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Two rules this flow protects\n**No fee number before the call.** The first message promises a confirmed government fee *before* any payment. Government fees differ by emirate, licence type and activity — never quote one from memory.\n\n**You do not issue licences.** The authority does. Every message says so, because promising an outcome you don't control is how setup agents get complaints.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-3884",
      "name": "Note 3884",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        1120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Moving a case forward\nPOST to the `matjari-setup-stage` webhook:\n\n`{ \"case_id\": \"SETUP-260821-104\",\n  \"phone\": \"971501234567\",\n  \"stage\": \"filed\",\n  \"note\": \"optional extra line\" }`\n\nStages: `docs_received` → `filed` → `licence_issued` → `store_live`",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-4918",
      "name": "Note 4918",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        940
      ]
    }
